<view class="space-y-6">
  <view class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm">
    <view class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <view>
        <view class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
          <Icon name="spark" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          <text>Static workbench preview · NOT_RUN</text>
        </view>
        <view class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">跨语言转换与形式化验证准备工作台</view>
        <view class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">编辑输入、查看目标与证明规格示例；真实执行和证据只由受控 Runner 与独立门禁产生。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <button type="button" disabled="{{isProcessing}}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm transition hover:bg-primary/90 disabled:opacity-50" bindtap="handleModernize">
          <Icon name="spark" class="{{`h-4 w-4 ${isProcessing ? &quot;animate-spin&quot; : &quot;&quot;}`}}" />
          <text>{{isProcessing ? "检查 Runner 绑定中..." : "检查真实执行条件"}}</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-b border-border pb-3">
      <button wx:for="{{PLAYGROUND_TABS}}" wx:for-item="tab" wx:key="tab.id" key="{{tab.id}}" type="button" aria-pressed="{{activeTab === tab.id}}" class="{{`inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition ${
                activeTab === tab.id
                  ? &quot;bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs&quot;
                  : &quot;text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground&quot;
              }`}}" bindtap="onTap">
        <Icon name="{{tab.icon}}" class="h-4 w-4" />
        <text>{{tab.label}}</text>
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view role="status" aria-live="polite" class="rounded-xl border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-950">
    <text>{{executionState}}</text>
    <text>·</text>
    <text>{{executionMessage}}</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{activeTab === 'code'}}" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <view class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-xs">
      <view class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <view class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <text class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500" />
          <text htmlFor="playground-source-code" class="font-semibold text-foreground">源语言输入 (Source Code)</text>
        </view>
        <view id="playground-source-language" aria-label="源语言" value="{{sourceLang}}" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-foreground focus:outline-hidden" bindchange="onChange">
          <view value="java">Java (Spring / Enterprise)</view>
          <view value="csharp">C# (.NET Core)</view>
          <view value="cobol">COBOL (Mainframe / IBM)</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <textarea id="playground-source-code" aria-label="源代码输入" value="{{sourceCode}}" rows="{{16}}" class="w-full resize-y rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/20 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-foreground focus:border-primary focus:outline-hidden" spellCheck="{{false}}" bindchange="onChange" />
      <view class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        <text>Lines: {{sourceCode.split("\n").length}}</text>
        <text>Parser: NOT_RUN</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-xs">
      <view class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <view class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <text class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500" />
          <text htmlFor="playground-target-code" class="font-semibold text-foreground">静态目标示例（非转换结果）</text>
          <text class="rounded-md bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-amber-700">NOT_RUN</text>
        </view>
        <view id="playground-target-language" aria-label="目标语言" value="{{targetLang}}" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-foreground focus:outline-hidden" bindchange="onChange">
          <view value="csharp">C# (.NET 9 / Modern)</view>
          <view value="rust">Rust (2024 / Memory-Safe)</view>
          <view value="go">Go (1.23 / Cloud-Native)</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <textarea id="playground-target-code" aria-label="静态目标代码示例" readOnly="true" value="{{targetCode}}" rows="{{16}}" class="w-full resize-y rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/40 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-foreground focus:outline-hidden" spellCheck="{{false}}" />
      <view class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        <text>Execution: NOT_RUN</text>
        <text>Certification: NOT_CERTIFIED</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{activeTab === 'ast'}}" class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-xs">
    <view class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <view class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">多阶段语法语义拓扑与不变式传递链</view>
      <text class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Graph: Acyclic Transformation DAG</text>
    </view>
    <view class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <view wx:for="{{astNodes}}" wx:for-item="node" wx:for-index="idx" wx:key="node.id" key="{{node.id}}" class="relative flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-border/80 bg-muted/20 p-4 transition hover:border-primary/50">
        <view class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <text class="text-xs font-mono text-muted-foreground">Step 0 {{idx + 1}}</text>
          <text class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            <Icon name="test" class="h-3 w-3" />
            <text>NOT_RUN</text>
          </text>
        </view>
        <view class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">{{node.label}}</view>
        <view class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">{{node.details}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{activeTab === 'lean4'}}" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <view class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-xs">
      <view class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <text class="font-semibold text-foreground">Lean 4 形式化定理规格 (.lean)</text>
        <text class="rounded-md bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono text-primary">Lean 4.8.0 Kernel</text>
      </view>
      <pre class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-foreground overflow-x-auto">{{`-- SPECIFICATION EXAMPLE ONLY — NOT GENERATED OR CHECKED
import Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic

theorem PreserveNonNegativeBalance 
  (balance : Real) (amount : Real)
  (h_pos : amount > 0)
  (h_sufficient : balance >= amount) :
  balance - amount >= 0 := by
  intro h1 h2
  omega`}}</pre>
    </view>
    <view class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-xs">
      <view class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <text class="font-semibold text-foreground">Dafny 严密方法契约 (.dfy)</text>
        <text class="rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Dafny 4.4.0</text>
      </view>
      <pre class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-foreground overflow-x-auto">{{`// SPECIFICATION EXAMPLE ONLY — NOT GENERATED OR VERIFIED
method {:verify true} Withdraw(balance: int, amount: int) returns (newBal: int, ok: bool)
  requires balance >= 0
  requires amount > 0
  ensures ok ==> newBal == balance - amount && newBal >= 0
  ensures !ok ==> newBal == balance
{
  if balance >= amount {
    newBal := balance - amount;
    ok := true;
  } else {
    newBal := balance;
    ok := false;
  }
}`}}</pre>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{activeTab === 'pr_daemon'}}" class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-xs space-y-4">
    <view class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <view>
        <view class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Git PR 自愈流程静态示例</view>
        <view class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">仅展示预期补丁形状；未接收 Webhook、未创建分支、未推送或审批 Pull Request。</view>
      </view>
      <text class="rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SCM EFFECTS: NOT_RUN</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/20 p-4">
      <view class="text-xs font-mono text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">Illustrative Git Diff (not generated)</view>
      <pre class="mt-2 text-xs font-mono text-foreground overflow-x-auto">{{`--- a/src/main/java/LegacyAccount.java
+++ b/src/main/java/LegacyAccount.java
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 public class LegacyAccount {
-  public Vector<String> history = new Vector<>();
+  public List<String> history = new ArrayList<>();
 }`}}</pre>
    </view>
    <view class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4">
      <view class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">SAMPLE_ONLY · Review NOT_RUN</view>
      <view class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">此示例没有执行规则检查，也没有创建或推送 `elmos-fix/pr-142` 分支；需要 SCM 授权、Runner 回执和独立复核后才能产生真实结论。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
